{% comment %}
=================================================================================
PLACEMENT EDITOR — Direct upload → canvas, no AI-studio detour
=================================================================================
This template is the landing page for the "Upload your design" path of the
creator pipeline. It renders the `creator-upload-studio` section directly, so
users never bounce through /pages/ai-studio (which is reserved for the
AI-assisted design flow).

Flow:
  /pages/become-creator
    → user picks "Upload your design" + file picker
    → file is stashed in sessionStorage as `mn_pending_upload`
    → redirect here: /pages/placement-editor?intent=creator_upload
    → creator-upload-studio reads the pending upload, shows canvas,
      lets user pick color + placement, then saves a draft and routes to
      /pages/creator-onboarding.

Create the Shopify Page with handle `placement-editor` and assign this template.
=================================================================================
{% endcomment %}

<script>
  window.ENV = Object.assign({}, window.ENV || {}, {
    SUPABASE_URL: "{{ settings.supabase_url | default: '' | escape }}",
    SUPABASE_ANON_KEY: "{{ settings.supabase_anon_key | default: '' | escape }}"
  });
</script>

{% section 'creator-upload-studio' %}

<style>
  /* Keep Shopify header/footer visible and layered above section content */
  #shopify-section-header,
  .site-header,
  header[role="banner"],
  .header-wrapper,
  #shopify-section-group-header-group {
    position: sticky !important;
    top: 0 !important;
    z-index: 9999 !important;
  }
  #shopify-section-footer,
  footer[role="contentinfo"],
  .site-footer {
    position: relative !important;
    z-index: 1 !important;
  }
</style>
